  <section class="pages faq" id="faq">
    <div class="faq__header">
        <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
        <p>Everything you need to know about SweetDreams AI</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq__container">
        <div class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__question">How do I create the best stories?</div>
            <div class="faq__answer">
                Be specific and creative with your prompts! Instead of "a dragon," try "a tiny dragon who's afraid of fire."
                Use our "Use this idea" button for inspiration. The more details you provide, the more magical and personalized your story becomes.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__question">Is this really free?</div>
            <div class="faq__answer">
              <strong>Yes, absolutely!</strong> SweetDreams AI is completely free to use. We believe every child deserves magical bedtime stories,
                and we're committed to keeping it that way. No hidden fees, no subscriptions - just sweet dreams.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__question">Can I save my stories?</div>
            <div class="faq__answer">
                Currently, stories are generated on-the-fly. We recommend copying and pasting your favorite stories into a notes app
                or document to save them for later. Bookmarking special ones is a great way to build your own story collection!
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__question">What age groups is this for?</div>
            <div class="faq__answer">
                SweetDreams AI is perfect for all ages! Our stories are family-friendly and can be tailored for:
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Toddlers (2-4):</strong> Simple, repetitive stories with friendly animals</li>
                    <li><strong>Children (5-8):</strong> Adventurous tales with mild challenges and happy endings</li>
                    <li><strong>Older Kids (9+):</strong> More complex plots and character development</li>
                    <li><strong>Even adults</strong> enjoy our calming, creative stories!</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__question">How does SweetDreams AI work?</div>
            <div class="faq__answer">
                We use advanced AI technology powered by Google's Gemini API. When you provide a story prompt,
                our AI analyzes it and generates a unique, gentle bedtime story designed to spark imagination and encourage peaceful sleep.
                Each story is created fresh - you'll never get the same story twice!
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__question">Can I request specific themes or characters?</div>
            <div class="faq__answer">
                Absolutely! That's the beauty of SweetDreams AI. You can request anything from "a princess who loves astronomy"
                to "a superhero squirrel saving the forest." The more specific you are, the better the story will match your vision.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-cta">
        <h2>Still Have Questions?</h2>
        <p>We're here to help! Reach out to us and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@sweetdreamsai.com" class="contact-btn"><img src="/icons/email.svg" width="30px" height="auto" alt="📧"> Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>

